EVALUATION.md §1, WIRE.md §5.6: an inline variant's key equal to a key of its parent but for letter case would read as a misspelling of its own; both loaders refuse it (gen/go in data mode here).
-- a/a.canon --
package a

/// A shape.
variant Shape {
  /// A box.
  box {
    /// Its side.
    side: Int
  }
}

/// A thing.
record Thing {
  /// Its side.
  Side: Int
  /// Its shape.
  shape: Shape @json(inline)
}

/// The things.
let things: table Thing = {
  one { Side: 1, shape: box { side: 2 } }
}

emit go { out: "@features/a", package: "a", mode: data }
emit json { out: "out/" }
-- a.things.json --
{"one": {"Side": 1, "kind": "box", "side": 2}}
-- findings.txt --
error[E8019]  a/a.canon:17:3
  emit go in data mode cannot generate an inline variant key equal to a parent key but for letter case

1 error, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
